--------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source is vendored into this repository. quarry links
the Rust crates declared in Cargo.toml, each under its own permissive
licence (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD or Unlicense); SQLite, compiled in
through libsqlite3-sys, is in the public domain. Their notices travel
with those crates.

quarry reads documentation produced by Capstone
(https://github.com/GentBajko/capstone, Apache-2.0) but bundles none
of it and does not invoke it.
